{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>找不到電視遙控器，或厭倦在搜尋欄逐格按鍵輸入文字？Remotify Pro TV Remote Control 讓 iPhone 透過同一個 Wi-Fi 網絡直接控制電視，首次配對只需輸入電視屏幕顯示的六位代碼，之後每次按鍵都即時送達，付費一次即可使用，沒有廣告、訂閱與內購。程式原價 US $2.99，現時限時免費，適合經常遺失遙控器、想用鍵盤與語音快速操作電視的用戶。</p>\n\n<h2>鍵盤語音輸入取代實體遙控</h2>\n<p>方向鍵、OK、返回與主頁鍵一應俱全，另有觸控板、數字鍵盤、音量鍵及播放控制。可直接用 iPhone 鍵盤在電視輸入搜尋字詞與密碼，剪貼簿同樣適用；按住麥克風即可語音輸入。程式另設 App 快捷鍵、媒體投放、睡眠計時，並可儲存多部電視。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-39-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-40-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-41-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-42-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-43-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-44-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Remotify Pro TV Remote Control</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T21:58:33.163885+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}